    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>From Highway to Hell · <strong>Price:</strong> you take the damage too.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Theme</strong> Fate</p><hr />\n<ul><li><strong>1:</strong> Reaction, surge: when you take damage, a creature within 30 ft takes the same damage (@Check[will|against:stand|basic]{basic Will}).</li><li><strong>5:</strong> Surge: you share your conditions too.</li><li><strong>9:</strong> Range 60 ft.</li><li><strong>13:</strong> Two creatures.</li><li><strong>17:</strong> You take half the damage.</li></ul>\n\n<p><em>Defaults: Stand, Occult and Concentrate traits; a surge costs 1 Stand Point and 2 actions unless listed; ranges are measured from your stand; untyped damage is force; saves use your stand DC.</em></p>",
